menuconfig MMC
    bool "MMC"
    help
      MMC class (pbl/drivers/mmc.h) and its drivers: an eMMC soldered to
      the board, as a block device the class powers up on use and down
      once idle.

if MMC

config MMC_IDLE_OFF_MS
    int "Idle time before the card is powered down, in ms"
    default 2000
    help
      The card is powered down once it has had no access for this long,
      and powered up again, which takes some tens of milliseconds, by the
      next access. 0 keeps it powered.

config MMC_STM32_SDMMC
    bool "STM32 SDMMC"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ST_STM32_SDMMC2_ENABLED
    select CLK
    select GPIO
    select PINCTRL
    select RESET
    help
      An eMMC on the SDMMC host of the STM32U5, polled, its data moved by
      the internal DMA of the host.

module = DRIVER_MMC
module-str = MMC
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_level"

endif # MMC
